* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_adc_core: R1 ADC core. Slice A: in0 = SIN, in1 = ISA. Slice B: in0 = COS, in1 = ISB.
* trk_enc samples SIN and COS together, trk_cur samples ISA and ISB together (one edge each).
* Conversion order per 1 us frame (30 MHz, 30 cycles): A in cycles 0-11, B in 12-23, track 24-29.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_adc_core sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trk_enc trk_cur mclk wina winb rst lat stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 codea codeb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref gnd
XTHA sinp sinn isap isan trk_enc trk_cur topap topan cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 vdd vref gnd r1_th
XTHB cosp cosn isbp isbn trk_enc trk_cur topbp topbn cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 vdd vref gnd r1_th
XCMPA topap topan clka clkab oap oan vdd gnd r1_cmp
XCMPB topbp topbn clkb clkbb obp obn vdd gnd r1_cmp
XSAR oap oan obp obn mclk wina winb rst lat stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 clka clkab clkb clkbb cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 codea codeb vdd gnd r1_sar_logic
.ends r1_adc_core

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_adc_core_fast: R1 ADC core. Slice A: in0 = SIN, in1 = ISA. Slice B: in0 = COS, in1 = ISB.
* trk_enc samples SIN and COS together, trk_cur samples ISA and ISB together (one edge each).
* Conversion order per 1 us frame (30 MHz, 30 cycles): A in cycles 0-11, B in 12-23, track 24-29.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_adc_core_fast sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trk_enc trk_cur mclk wina winb rst lat stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 codea codeb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref gnd
XTHA sinp sinn isap isan trk_enc trk_cur topap topan cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 vdd vref gnd r1_th_fast
XTHB cosp cosn isbp isbn trk_enc trk_cur topbp topbn cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 vdd vref gnd r1_th_fast
XCMPA topap topan clka clkab oap oan vdd gnd r1_cmp
XCMPB topbp topbn clkb clkbb obp obn vdd gnd r1_cmp
XSAR oap oan obp obn mclk wina winb rst lat stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 clka clkab clkb clkbb cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 codea codeb vdd gnd r1_sar_logic
.ends r1_adc_core_fast

* r1_adc_core_fast_a: r1_adc_core_fast with slice B and comparator B removed (comparator B inputs of
* the SAR logic tied). Same port list as r1_adc_core_fast. For static-linearity decks only.
.subckt r1_adc_core_fast_a sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trk_enc trk_cur mclk wina winb rst lat stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 codea codeb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref gnd
